  "biography": {
    "birthPlace": null,
    "birthYear": null,
    "content": [
      {
        "_key": "456a3b5af4c5",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "80d7e9906e38",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "    Meltem Sari (b. 1992, Istanbul) is a photographer and video artist based in Istanbul. She graduated from "
          },
          {
            "_key": "05c51c2e5803",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "Yıldız Technical University, Faculty of Art and Design, Department of Photography and Video"
          },
          {
            "_key": "5d7093f69edf",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " in 2018."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "0f0ab6d84aac",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "807f3c6b0dc0",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "        Her practice explores the liminal spaces between personal and collective memory, examining processes of remembering and the relationship between identity and place through a critical and conceptual lens. Working primarily with photography and video, she traces the visual and emotional residues that places leave on individuals."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "e4047178609b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "8a90026f5222",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "        Sari has held solo exhibitions at "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b01bc2248708",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "Adahan Art Gallery"
          },
          {
            "_key": "1481699295f8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " in Istanbul (2019) and "
          },
          {
            "_key": "e00c20c1f038",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "the Rodolfo Doval Fermi History and Art Museum"
          },
          {
            "_key": "332761da95c4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " in "
          },
          {
            "_key": "7eabbbae74bd",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "Argentina"
          },
          {
            "_key": "badacd34bd0a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " (2019), and has participated in group screenings at Bomonti Ada, Istanbul (2018). Her work has been featured in Turkish and international media, including "
          },
          {
            "_key": "78a203385405",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "Açık Radyo"
          },
          {
            "_key": "deafd6bb917e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "_key": "2d799a54bf89",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "Women TV"
          },
          {
            "_key": "eda1e6268d39",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", and the Argentine press outlets "
          },
          {
            "_key": "e96b7527e783",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "em"
            ],
            "text": "El Litoral and Ente Cultural Santafesino"
          },
          {
            "_key": "428beeeec56f",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
